===Etymology===
Apparently from {{af|ru|напили́ть|-ник}}, but the verb "to file" is actually {{m|ru|опили́ть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|напи́льник}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|напи́льник}}

# [[file]], [[rasp]] {{gloss|[[tool]]}}
#: {{syn|ru|напи́лок<q:colloquial>}}
